  "description": "Mi-Nu is a shy college student who becomes entangled in a whirlwind relationship with notorious bad guy Yu-Jin. Mi-Nu believes in true love, but Yujin only believes in one-night stands. Yu-Jin reveals his deepest secret to Mi-Nu in order to seduce him, but things take an unexpected twist when Yu-Jin develops feelings for Mi-Nu. Will Mi-Nu and Yujin be able to overcome their differences and find true love? \n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS)",
